# 安装目录 /usr/share/sddm/themes/lingmo 原本由 lingmo-sddm-theme 占用，
# 本包取代它（主题已由 SilentSDDM 品牌化而来）。
Conflicts: lingmo-sddm-theme
Replaces: lingmo-sddm-theme
Description: Lingmo - the SDDM login theme for Lingmo OS
 A lock screen and login screen for SDDM with static or animated
 (video) backgrounds, per-screen background effects and more than
 200 options, shipped with preset colour schemes (Catppuccin,
 Nord, Everforest, Gruvbox, Eldritch and others).
 .
 Based on SilentSDDM, with Lingmo OS branding, Chinese
 translations (zh_CN, zh_TW, zh_HK) and Debian packaging added.
 The original project is at
 https://github.com/uiriansan/SilentSDDM
 .
 It requires SDDM 0.21 or newer and Qt 6.5 or newer. The theme
 is installed to /usr/share/sddm/themes/lingmo; see
 README.Debian for how to enable it.
